すごい。マトモにくらったらかなりヤバい。ヤバすぎて鬼と呼ばれ、やがて野突鬼(ノヅキ)と呼ばれるようになった。\n顔のペイントはあったらかっこいいよな〜のノリでつけたりつけなかったり。\n大好物はりんご。\n\n\nご検討よろしくお願いします。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@togeunio/works/4", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/45b37c14/uploads/origins/30b39d1b-5b19-485d-a0cf-6394213963be?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=da23d5fcc33319e027d49912319b02d2", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/45b37c14/uploads/origins/30b39d1b-5b19-485d-a0cf-6394213963be?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=da23d5fcc33319e027d49912319b02d2, https://si.imgix.net/45b37c14/uploads/origins/30b39d1b-5b19-485d-a0cf-6394213963be?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=fecf1b65fc5f924123290303215a34e4 2x, https://si.imgix.net/45b37c14/uploads/origins/30b39d1b-5b19-485d-a0cf-6394213963be?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c0103ee4aca2891b6100f6f9b651820d 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "I'm requesting a picture of this character flexing muscles... I'm in love...\n\nhttps://x.com/togeunio/status/1911452017031299327/photo/1", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@togeunio/works/3", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/7705d600/uploads/origins/c6952748-2bd8-4e93-9906-ab6fb9f5de49?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f5f3375878a4eafce8a32244a3e3a738", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/7705d600/uploads/origins/c6952748-2bd8-4e93-9906-ab6fb9f5de49?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f5f3375878a4eafce8a32244a3e3a738, https://si.imgix.net/7705d600/uploads/origins/c6952748-2bd8-4e93-9906-ab6fb9f5de49?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ed7e2372c095a00907d69e01c332047b 2x, https://si.imgix.net/7705d600/uploads/origins/c6952748-2bd8-4e93-9906-ab6fb9f5de49?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm